# Vertical Packs

Verticals are **packs, not code paths**.

## Pack YAML (`packs/{vertical}/v1/pack.yaml`)
- `vocabulary`: domain labels mapped to `primitive` + legacy `kind`
- `metadata_schemas`: JSON-schema-shaped validation per label
- `lifecycle_rules`: generic state transitions (campaign end, archive)
- `rank_policy.primitive_weights`: retrieval precedence
- `eval_fixtures`: pointer to golden scenarios

## Do
- Add finance as `packs/finance/v1/pack.yaml`, not new DB enums.
- Wire behavior through `ApplyVerticalPack` and pack loader.
- Keep `profile|preference|fact` as Mem0-compat layer.

## Do not
- Add per-vertical `kind` values to Postgres or Go constants.
- Fork rank/search logic per vertical.
- Put marketing-only terms in core domain models.
